url: "https://github.com/Saehon/Saeid-Homayoun/tree/main/NAAIL-OpenLab"
abstract: >-
  NAAIL OpenLab is a research-first, human-led artificial intelligence platform for business-school education, audit simulation, and reproducible scientific discovery. Version 0.2.2 advances the public Audit Digital Twin program to Prototype 002, with a modular synthetic Client XYZ revenue-recognition benchmark, explicit Materiality and Risk roles, Evidence Passport and Professional Decision DAG concepts, provider-neutral model comparison, frozen audit-quality metrics, reproducibility tests, and a mandatory Human Gate. Detailed orchestration and patent-sensitive implementation remain private.
